flowchart TD
    User["User: work open / save / kill / init"]
    Main["main.cpp<br/>CLI and workspace coordination"]
    Project["project.cpp<br/>Configuration, paths, YAML, atomic writes"]
    Process["process.cpp<br/>Run external commands and capture results"]
    Files[("Configuration and state files")]
    Tmux["tmux<br/>Dedicated server per project"]
    Inator["tmuxinator<br/>Create initial workspace"]
    Resurrect["tmux-resurrect<br/>Save and restore workspace"]
    Apps["Windows and panes<br/>Shells, editors, other programs"]

    User --> Main
    Main --> Project
    Project <--> Files
    Main --> Process
    Process --> Tmux
    Process --> Inator
    Process --> Resurrect
    Inator --> Tmux
    Resurrect <--> Tmux
    Resurrect <--> Files
    Tmux --> Apps
    Tmux -. "Detach hook invokes work save" .-> Main
